+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-1"><span><strong>办理入职手续</strong><small>向人力资源同事提交所需材料，确认合同与员工信息。</small><span class="task-tag">人力资源</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-2"><span><strong>领取设备，设置工作环境</strong><small>领取电脑与门禁，连接办公网络，检查设备是否正常。</small><span class="task-tag">行政 / IT</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-3"><span><strong>激活邮箱与协作账号</strong><small>按邀请邮件完成登录，修改初始密码并开启多因素验证。</small><span class="task-tag">系统账号</span></span></label>
+            </div>
+            <div id="day-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-2" hidden><div class="day-heading"><div><span class="day-number">02</span><h3>和未来的伙伴打个招呼</h3></div><span class="day-fraction" data-count="2">0 / 3</span></div>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-1"><span><strong>与直属主管沟通</strong><small>了解岗位职责、近期目标，以及第一周的具体安排。</small><span class="task-tag">直属主管</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-2"><span><strong>认识团队与入职伙伴</strong><small>做一次简短自我介绍，了解大家的分工与协作方式。</small><span class="task-tag">团队协作</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-3"><span><strong>加入工作群与团队日历</strong><small>确认常用沟通渠道，了解例会时间与会议约定。</small><span class="task-tag">办公协作</span></span></label>
+            </div>
+            <div id="day-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-3" hidden><div class="day-heading"><div><span class="day-number">03</span><h3>了解我们正在做的事情</h3></div><span class="day-fraction" data-count="3">0 / 3</span></div>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="3-1"><span><strong>阅读员工手册</strong><small>熟悉考勤、请假、报销与信息安全要求，记录不清楚的地方。</small><span class="task-tag">规章制度</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="3-2"><span><strong>了解产品与业务</strong><small>阅读业务介绍，与伙伴一起梳理主要用户和工作流程。</small><span class="task-tag">业务学习</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="3-3"><span><strong>确认岗位所需权限</strong><small>尝试访问团队文档与项目空间，向负责人申请缺失的权限。</small><span class="task-tag">系统账号</span></span></label>
+            </div>
+            <div id="day-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-4" hidden><div class="day-heading"><div><span class="day-number">04</span><h3>从一件小事开始参与</h3></div><span class="day-fraction" data-count="4">0 / 3</span></div>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="4-1"><span><strong>领取第一项工作任务</strong><small>与主管确认任务范围、交付时间和完成标准。</small><span class="task-tag">直属主管</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="4-2"><span><strong>走一遍团队协作流程</strong><small>在伙伴协助下完成一次任务更新、文档提交或成果评审。</small><span class="task-tag">动手实践</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="4-3"><span><strong>及时同步问题与进展</strong><small>整理遇到的疑问，与相关同事确认下一步行动。</small><span class="task-tag">团队协作</span></span></label>
+            </div>
+            <div id="day-5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-5" hidden><div class="day-heading"><div><span class="day-number">05</span><h3>回看这一周，准备下一步</h3></div><span class="day-fraction" data-count="5">0 / 3</span></div>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="5-1"><span><strong>整理第一周收获</strong><small>记录已经了解的事情、完成的任务和仍待解决的问题。</small><span class="task-tag">个人回顾</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="5-2"><span><strong>与主管进行一次反馈沟通</strong><small>交流入职体验，确认所需支持和下一周的优先事项。</small><span class="task-tag">直属主管</span></span></label>
+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="5-3"><span><strong>制定下一周的小目标</strong><small>将目标拆成具体行动，写入自己的工作计划。</small><span class="task-tag">下一步</span></span></label>
+            </div>
