+              <label class="task"><input type="checkbox" data-task="5-3"><span><strong>制定下一周的小目标</strong><small>将目标拆成具体行动，写入自己的工作计划。</small><span class="task-tag">下一步</span></span></label>
+            </div>
+            <div class="task-footer"><span aria-hidden="true">◷</span><span id="save-status" role="status">勾选记录仅保存在当前浏览器</span></div>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+        <aside class="right-column"><section class="tip-card"><span class="section-kicker">A LITTLE REMINDER</span><span class="tip-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h2>不必第一天<br>就弄懂所有事。</h2><p>遇到问题时，随时提问。<br>你的主管、入职伙伴和支持团队，<br>都可以成为你的第一站。</p><a href="#help">找到可以帮助你的人 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><section class="packing"><h3><span aria-hidden="true">▧</span> 第一天的小准备</h3><ul><li>按入职通知准备相关材料</li><li>确认到岗时间与办公地点</li><li>保留招聘或人事联系人的信息</li></ul><p>具体安排以公司入职通知为准。</p></section></aside>
+      </div>
+      <section id="accounts" class="accounts-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">GET CONNECTED</span><h2>常用系统与账号</h2></div><span class="pill neutral">先开通，再连接</span></div><p class="section-description">以下为通用配置指引。公司实际系统名称、入口及联系人待补充，请向对应负责人确认。</p><div class="accounts-grid">
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon mail" aria-hidden="true">@</span><span><strong>企业邮箱</strong><small>邮件往来 · 账号身份</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>由 IT 分配的企业邮箱地址</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>向 IT 获取激活通知，首次登录修改密码。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系 IT 支持。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>IT 支持</span><span>入职首日开通</span></div></details>
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon chat" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><span><strong>即时通讯与协作</strong><small>团队沟通 · 会议日历</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>企业邮箱或入职登记手机号</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>接受企业邀请，确认加入正确的组织。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系入职伙伴。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>入职伙伴</span><span>入职首日开通</span></div></details>
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon people" aria-hidden="true">♧</span><span><strong>人事与考勤</strong><small>个人信息 · 请假考勤</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>工号或企业统一身份账号</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>由人力资源创建，登录后核对个人信息。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系人力资源。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>人力资源</span><span>第一周确认</span></div></details>
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon docs" aria-hidden="true">▥</span><span><strong>知识库与云文档</strong><small>员工手册 · 团队资料</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>企业统一身份账号或受邀邮箱</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>接受团队空间邀请，按岗位申请文档权限。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系入职伙伴。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>入职伙伴</span><span>第一周确认</span></div></details>
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon project" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><span><strong>项目与任务管理</strong><small>工作计划 · 进度协同</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>企业邮箱或企业统一身份账号</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>由项目负责人邀请，并分配项目角色。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系直属主管。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>直属主管</span><span>按岗位申请</span></div></details>
+        <details class="account"><summary><span class="app-icon finance" aria-hidden="true">¥</span><span><strong>财务与报销</strong><small>费用申请 · 报销流程</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="account-details"><dl><dt>登录账号</dt><dd>工号或企业统一身份账号</dd><dt>开通方式</dt><dd>向财务确认权限及报销规范，按需开通。</dd><dt>系统入口</dt><dd>待补充，请联系财务支持。</dd></dl></div><div class="account-meta"><span>财务支持</span><span>按需开通</span></div></details>
+      </div><div class="security-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><p>账号小提醒：请勿分享密码或验证码；遇到登录或权限问题，联系 IT 支持处理。</p></div></section>
+      <section id="help" class="help-section"><div><span class="section-kicker">WE ARE HERE FOR YOU</span><h2>有疑问，找到对的人</h2><p>联系人及联系方式待公司补充。</p></div><div class="help-item"><span>01</span><strong>人力资源</strong><p>入职手续、考勤与福利</p></div><div class="help-item"><span>02</span><strong>IT / 行政</strong><p>账号权限、设备与办公环境</p></div><div class="help-item"><span>03</span><strong>主管 / 入职伙伴</strong><p>工作安排、业务与团队协作</p></div></section>
+      <footer><span>新的开始 · 新员工入职指南</span><span>通用参考模板 · 具体流程以公司规定为准</span><a href="#overview">回到顶部 ↑</a></footer>
+    </main>
+  </div>
+  <script>
+    const boxes = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-task]')];
+    const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]')];
+    const storageKey = 'new-chapter-onboarding-v1';
+    let canSave = true;
+    try { const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storageKey) || '{}'); boxes.forEach(box => { box.checked = saved?.[box.dataset.task] === true; }); } catch { canSave = false; }
+    function updateProgress() {
+      const count = boxes.filter(box => box.checked).length;
+      document.getElementById('completed-count').textContent = count;
+      document.getElementById('overall-progress').value = count;
+      document.getElementById('progress-percent').textContent = Math.round(count / boxes.length * 100) + '%';
+      document.getElementById('progress-label').textContent = count === 15 ? '第一周清单已完成，做得很好！' : count ? '每一步，都在慢慢熟悉' : '准备好迈出第一步';
+      document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(el => { el.textContent = boxes.filter(box => box.dataset.task.startsWith(el.dataset.count + '-') && box.checked).length + ' / 3'; });
+      if (!canSave) document.getElementById('save-status').textContent = '浏览器未允许保存，进度仅在本次页面有效';
+    }
+    boxes.forEach(box => box.addEventListener('change', () => {
+      try { localStorage.setItem(storageKey, JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(boxes.map(item => [item.dataset.task, item.checked])))); canSave = true; document.getElementById('save-status').textContent = '进度已保存到当前浏览器'; } catch { canSave = false; }
+      updateProgress();
+    }));
+    function selectDay(tab) {
+      tabs.forEach(item => { const selected = item === tab; item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(selected)); item.tabIndex = selected ? 0 : -1; document.getElementById('day-' + item.dataset.day).hidden = !selected; });
+    }
+    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
+      tab.addEventListener('click', () => selectDay(tab));
+      tab.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
+        let next;
+        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') next = (index + 1) % tabs.length;
+        if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') next = (index + tabs.length - 1) % tabs.length;
+        if (event.key === 'Home') next = 0;
+        if (event.key === 'End') next = tabs.length - 1;
+        if (next !== undefined) { event.preventDefault(); selectDay(tabs[next]); tabs[next].focus(); }
+      });
+    });
+    document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', () => { document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(item => item.classList.toggle('active', item === link)); }));
+    updateProgress();
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
diff --git a/style.css b/style.css
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..278ceb1c13f7366acc725877a28b15065e1f6ac3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/style.css
@@ -0,0 +1,157 @@
+@layer measure;
+:root { color-scheme: light; --ink: #302f3d; --muted: #74717f; --purple: #7059ad; --line: #e9e7ee; --soft: #f3f0f9; }
+* { box-sizing: border-box; }
+html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 24px; }
+body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: #faf9fc; font-family: system-ui, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; }
+a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
+button, input { font: inherit; }
+button, summary, input { cursor: pointer; }
+a, button, summary, input { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
+:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #9473ce; outline-offset: 5px; }
+h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
+button { color: inherit; }
+[hidden] { display: none !important; }
+.skip { position: fixed; top: -100px; left: 20px; padding: 12px; background: white; z-index: 10; }
+.skip:focus { top: 10px; }
+.sidebar { width: 232px; height: 100vh; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; padding: 35px 23px 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
+.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 650; }
+.brand-mark { display: grid; place-items: center; position: relative; width: 38px; height: 40px; background: var(--purple); color: white; border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 3px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; }
+.brand-mark span { position: absolute; top: 1px; right: 4px; color: #d6f0b9; }
+.brand small { display: block; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #85818d; margin-top: 2px; }
+.nav-label { color: #98929f; font-size: 12px; margin: 49px 14px 12px; }
+nav { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
+nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 7px; color: #736d7f; }
+nav a > span:first-child { font-size: 23px; width: 23px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; }
+nav a.active, nav a:hover { color: var(--purple); background: #f0ebf8; }
+nav a.active { font-weight: 600; }
+.nav-count { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: #8f879e; }
+.sidebar-note { margin-top: auto; padding: 24px 10px 34px; }
+.note-symbol { display: block; font-size: 34px; color: #b6a8cf; margin-bottom: 15px; }
+.sidebar-note strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
+.sidebar-note p { font-size: 12px; color: #8e8798; margin-top: 8px; }
+.sidebar-bottom { display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; color: #8e8798; }
+.sidebar-bottom > span:last-child { margin-left: auto; }
+.small-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8ba58a; }
+.workspace { margin-left: 232px; }
+.topbar { height: 76px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 42px; font-size: 12px; color: #8b8594; }
+.topbar div > span { margin: 0 14px; color: #c7c2ce; }
+.topbar strong { font-weight: 500; color: #5b5565; }
+.top-tag { color: #7d7489; }
+.top-tag > span { margin-left: 17px; }
+main { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 34px 42px 0; }
+.hero { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden; min-height: 335px; background: #efebf7; border-radius: 13px; padding: 37px 38px; }
+.hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
+.eyebrow, .section-kicker { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.7px; color: #8a7c9e; font-weight: 650; }
+.eyebrow { margin-bottom: 17px; }
+h1 { font-size: clamp(27px, 2.6vw, 38px); font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.45; }
+.hero p { color: #7c738b; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; }
+.primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; background: var(--purple); color: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; }
+.primary:hover { background: #5f499b; }
+.hero-meta { font-size: 12px; margin-left: 15px; color: #8a809a; }
+.hero-art { position: absolute; right: 30px; top: 14px; width: 330px; height: 320px; }
+.paper { position: absolute; top: 42px; left: 76px; width: 189px; height: 236px; padding: 25px 22px; background: #fffdf7; transform: rotate(9deg); border: 1px solid #e6dfec; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 12px 13px 0 #ddd5ed; }
+.paper-label { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #9885b0; }
+.paper-title { display: block; font-size: 31px; font-weight: 600; color: #635179; margin: 18px 0; line-height: 1.45; }
+.paper-line { width: 87px; height: 4px; background: #eae5ee; margin-top: 9px; }
+.paper-line.short { width: 57px; }
+.paper-stamp { position: absolute; right: -19px; bottom: 14px; display: grid; place-content: center; width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d5e4b9; color: #566340; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center; transform: rotate(-20deg); }
+.orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid #dad0e9; border-radius: 50%; }
+.orbit-one { width: 300px; height: 300px; top: 13px; left: 25px; }
+.orbit-two { width: 360px; height: 360px; top: -17px; left: -5px; }
+.spark { position: absolute; z-index: 1; color: #a793c2; }
+.spark-one { top: 19px; right: 35px; font-size: 40px; }
+.spark-two { left: 10px; bottom: 49px; font-size: 37px; }
+.floating-tag { position: absolute; bottom: 4px; left: 46px; padding: 8px 17px; background: white; border: 1px solid #e9e2f0; border-radius: 6px; transform: rotate(-5deg); font-size: 12px; color: #7c6d8e; }
+.floating-tag span { color: #759864; margin-right: 6px; }
+.overview-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.25fr; align-items: center; margin: 23px 0 37px; padding: 19px 24px; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; }
+.overview-strip > div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
+.overview-strip > div + div { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); padding-left: 26px; }
+.stat-icon { background: #f5f2f9; color: #9b86b9; width: 39px; height: 39px; border-radius: 9px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; }
+.overview-strip strong { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
+.overview-strip small { display: block; color: #918997; font-size: 12px; }
+.overview-strip .progress-stat { display: block; }
+.progress-stat > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
+.progress-stat strong, #progress-percent { font-size: 12px; color: #857991; font-weight: 400; }
+progress { appearance: none; width: 100%; height: 6px; display: block; margin-top: 13px; border: none; background: #eeeaf3; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; }
+progress::-webkit-progress-bar { background: #eeeaf3; }
+progress::-webkit-progress-value { background: #9279b7; border-radius: 6px; }
+progress::-moz-progress-bar { background: #9279b7; }
+.content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 257px; gap: 27px; }
+.section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; align-items: center; }
+h2 { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px; }
+.pill { border-radius: 5px; background: #eee8f7; color: #8b74a9; font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 9px; white-space: nowrap; }
+.section-description { margin: 10px 0 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #87808f; max-width: 52em; }
+.day-tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
+.day-tabs button { border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; border-radius: 7px; padding: 10px 3px; font-size: 13px; color: #7f778a; line-height: 1.75; }
+.day-tabs button small { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #9d94a8; }
+.day-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { border-color: #dcd0ed; background: #f0ebf7; color: #77549d; font-weight: 600; }
+.day-tabs button:hover { background: #f0ebf7; }
+.task-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; background: white; overflow: hidden; }
+.day-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
+.day-heading > div { display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: center; }
+.day-number { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; color: #c1b3d2; }
+h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
+.day-fraction { font-size: 12px; color: #9e95a8; white-space: nowrap; }
+.task { display: flex; gap: 13px; padding: 19px 0; margin: 0 24px; cursor: pointer; }
+.task + .task { border-top: 1px solid #f1eef4; }
+.task input { appearance: none; flex-shrink: 0; width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 1px solid #d6cfdf; border-radius: 5px; background: #fff; margin: 4px 0 0; display: grid; place-items: center; }
+.task input:checked { background: var(--purple); border-color: var(--purple); }
+.task input:checked::after { content: '✓'; color: white; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1; }
+.task input:checked + span > strong { color: #92859f; text-decoration: line-through; }
+.task strong { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 550; }
+.task small { display: block; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; color: #8c8496; margin-top: 4px; }
+.task-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 3px; background: #f5f3f7; color: #8b7f98; font-size: 10px; margin-top: 7px; }
+.task-footer { background: #fcfbfd; display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 11px; color: #9a90a5; }
+.right-column { padding-top: 4px; }
+.tip-card { padding: 25px 24px; background: #f0f2e9; border: 1px solid #e7eadd; border-radius: 9px; position: relative; }
+.tip-card .section-kicker { font-size: 9px; color: #8f957c; letter-spacing: 1px; }
+.tip-star { display: block; color: #a2b18d; font-size: 43px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 21px 0 15px; }
+.tip-card h2 { color: #565e49; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500; }
+.tip-card p { margin: 13px 0 21px; font-size: 12px; color: #858c78; line-height: 1.9; }
+.tip-card a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #6f7d5c; font-size: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #dde2d2; padding-top: 17px; }
+.packing { padding: 24px 5px 0; }
+.packing h3 { font-size: 14px; }
+.packing h3 span { color: #a291b7; margin-right: 6px; }
+.packing ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 14px 0; color: #83798f; font-size: 12px; }
+.packing li { padding: 3px 0; }
+.packing li::marker { color: #bbb0c7; }
+.packing p { color: #a197ab; font-size: 11px; }
+.accounts-section { margin-top: 37px; }
+.neutral { color: #89818f; background: #efedf2; }
